---
/**
 * The home page's banner: the library hero art across the page with the Errant Ant logo standing on its big blue center
 * tile. The art covers the banner around its center, like a picture with `object-fit: cover`, while the logo keeps its
 * place on the art; the banner fades in with the home page and out when the bar moves to another page.
 */
---
<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-stage">
    <img class="banner-art" src="/brand/hero.webp" alt="" width="3840" height="1240" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
    <h1 class="banner-logo">
      <img src="/brand/logo.webp" alt="Errant Ant" width="853" height="720" decoding="async" />
    </h1>
  </div>
</div>
